  data: {
    LLM: "Choose attributes where your top card's value is strong relative to what you have seen. Avoid categories where your card is weak.\n\nRemember which attribute values have already been played or are likely on opponents' cards. When you are likely to lose a round, sometimes choosing an attribute where you might tie forces a center pile and gives you another chance to choose.\n\nTrack the distribution of values across the pack if possible; prioritise winning when you can choose so you keep the lead and control the category.",
